# Guiones Pipeline Rules

- Structured pipeline entry: `runGuionesStructuredPipeline()` in `api/lib/guiones/script-pipeline.ts`
- Legacy fallback still exists in `api/chat.ts` — check which path runs before editing prompts
- Pipeline stages: context profile → angles → briefs → draft → quality gate → repair
- Types in `api/lib/guiones/types.ts`; tests in `test/*.spec.ts`
- Run `npm test` after pipeline changes
- Frontend: `ProductWorkspace.tsx` → `grokApi.ts` → `/api/chat` → `scriptParser.ts`
- Script taxonomy uses Ian methodology types — see skill reference for full list
- Do not add more prompt layers to legacy path; extend structured pipeline instead
